========================================
HERO SECTION – AI-DRIVEN PROCUREMENT
========================================

Title:
AI-Driven Procurement with Complete Transparency

Description:
ODIN redesigns the procure-to-pay (P2P) lifecycle to be transparent,
auditable, secure, and AI-driven. The platform improves sourcing outcomes,
eliminates manual inefficiencies, and provides visibility to leadership.

Highlighted Points:
- 100% decision traceability and auditability
- Smart sourcing recommendations
- Reduced risk and improved compliance
- Real-time leadership transparency

Buttons:
- Explore AI-driven sourcing
- View how internal sourcing works
- Learn how external sourcing flow happens

Internal Sourcing Workflow:
1. Internal Requisition  
2. Expiry Optimization  
3. Central Stock  
4. Store Issue  

External Sourcing Workflow:
1. RFQ  
2. PO  
3. GRN  
4. Invoice  
5. Payment  

