========================================
PRODUCT – ODIN P2P (PROCURE-TO-PAY)
========================================

A secure, AI-powered, end-to-end multi-tenant Procure-to-Pay system that
enables intelligent sourcing and full lifecycle procurement automation.

Capabilities:

1. End-to-End Automation  
   Full P2P lifecycle: requisition → sourcing → RFQ → PO → GRN → invoicing → payments.

2. AI-Driven Intelligence  
   Supplier selection, forecasting, negotiation insights, spend visibility.

3. Security with Transparency  
   Tenant isolation, audit logs, explainable decision visibility.

4. Flexible & Scalable  
   Configurable workflows, compliance enforcement, API-first microservices.

