========================================

ODIN’s WhatsApp AI Assistant enables natural, multilingual conversations
between teams, vendors, and customers.  
It converts chats/calls into structured business insights.

Key Capabilities:

1. Multilingual Conversations  
   Chat or voice in any supported language.

2. AI Call & Chat Intelligence  
   Automatically extracts insights, commitments, and decisions.

3. Smart Summaries  
   Generates instant summaries of conversations.

4. Action Item Identification  
   Detects tasks, follow-ups, responsibilities.

5. Business Integration  
   Integrates with existing systems or functions standalone.

Tagline:
"Simple to use. Familiar like WhatsApp. Powerful for business communication."

========================================
PRODUCT – AI DOCUMENT INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM
========================================

Transforms unstructured documents into structured business intelligence.

Key Features:

1. Intelligent OCR + Field Extraction  
   Extracts key fields from invoices, contracts, registrations, etc.

2. Entity-Driven Mapping  
   Links documents to suppliers, assets, departments, transactions.

3. AI-Ready Repository  
   Converts files into searchable datasets.

4. Workflow Automation  
   Enables onboarding, approval checks, 3-way match, compliance.

5. Multi-Tenant Security  
   Governance, encryption, scalable storage.

6. Natural Language Search  
   Retrieve documents using business context.

